				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῦρο τόδ᾽ ἵκετο πήματα πάσχων π.</span>”
				<i>wandering from place to place,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.525
				</span></i>
			.</div>
